    {
      h2: 'Frozen food transport, by the same faces',
      paras: [
        "Most frozen loads that go wrong don't fail on the motorway. They fail at the dock: product loaded soft, a door left open, a driver who doesn't know your site. We're a crew of four, so whoever turns up has been to your dock before.",
        "We check the unit's set point and the product temperature at pick-up and at drop, and write both down. If you need proof, we send a photo of the reading the same day.",
